# Architecture Decisions (ADRs)

- **Solo playbook** (propose / deliberate / approve): `docs/adrs/README.md`
- **Accepted ADRs** (current recommendations): `docs/adrs/*-accepted.md` — read explicitly
- **Agent skill** (use / cite / conflict / maintain): `adr-awareness` in `.agents/skills/adr-awareness/`
- On cross-cutting work (tooling/build setup or durable content structure), load relevant Accepted ADRs and follow them. Do not silently conflict. Do not approve ADRs; the solo owner owns deliberation and status changes.
- Deviations require an explicit human-owned exception (trail it) or a human superseding ADR.
- Proposed ADRs are not binding until Accepted.
